Package: shapecomplexity
Type: Package
Title: Edge Amount and Macro-Shape Complexity of Leaf Outlines
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Tobias", "Trauden", email = "ToTrauden@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Measures the edge amount (EA, teeth and other fine margin features) and the
    macro-shape complexity (MC, lobes and other coarse features) of leaf outlines and other
    biological shapes from images, plus blade elongation and petiole length. A pure-R port of
    the Python reference implementation of the method; every step copies the exact library
    algorithm of the reference (Pillow bilinear resize and polygon fill, SciPy Gaussian filter
    and exact distance transform, scikit-image marching squares, NumPy interpolation and
    summation order), so that both give the same numbers. The Rust program 'ShapeComplexity'
    (<https://github.com/Thornbach/ShapeComplexity>) implements the same method.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Thornbach/ShapeComplexity
BugReports: https://github.com/Thornbach/ShapeComplexity/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    nabor,
